<BRK/>
<OLI>Flue gas temperature entering economizer:  [_____] degrees<MET> C</MET><ENG> F</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Flue gas temperature leaving economizer:  [_____] degrees<MET> C</MET><ENG> F</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
