<NPR>NOTE:  At the text below, analysis of the water available for makeup shall govern the water treatment system selected.  
A competent water treating consultant shall be obtained to formulate specific system recommendations when the 
makeup water analysis indicates any of the following:</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>1.  Iron in excess of 0.1 ppm as Fe.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>2.  Mg alkalinity in excess of 50 ppm as CaCO3.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>3.  Silica in excess of 6 ppm as SiO2.</NPR><BRK/>
