<SPT><TTL>Oil/Burner Windbox Package</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Burner turndown ratio on the specified fuel oil shall be not less than eight to one, with excess air not over 15 percent at full steam load, and 
excess air not over 22 percent at 20 percent steam load.[  Air flow shall be modulated through a single set of register louvers.]</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
